WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Three weeks. Eight teams.
A championship built on more than a fast answer.

00:05.000 --> 00:13.000
It started with a simple challenge: make a plan,
prove it with evidence, and be ready to defend it.

00:13.000 --> 00:18.000
Nova's first budget looked perfect.
Until delivery arrived.

00:18.000 --> 00:25.000
Their best move wasn't the first answer.
It was the correction.

00:25.000 --> 00:32.000
Then came the graph nobody agreed on.
Atlas spotted the scale. Comets questioned the claim.

00:32.000 --> 00:39.000
The room got louder.
The evidence got stronger.

00:39.000 --> 00:46.000
By week three, the Falcons had rebuilt their explanation,
and Nova had found its rhythm.

00:46.000 --> 00:51.000
Nobody stayed where they started.

00:51.000 --> 00:58.000
Three rounds of learning became the seeds.
Eight teams. Four places in the championship show.

00:58.000 --> 01:04.000
Everyone stays part of the night.

01:04.000 --> 01:10.000
The next answer could change the scoreboard.
The last wager could change the ending.

01:10.000 --> 01:15.000
Teams, take your places.
This is the Championship Show.
